{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21049","headline":"有所思 · 李贺","name":"有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年陌上歌离曲，今日君书远游蜀。\n帘外花开二月风，台前泪滴千行竹。\n琴心与妾肠，此夜断还续。\n想君白马悬雕弓，世间何处无春风。\n君心未肯镇如石，妾颜不久如花红。\n夜残高碧横长河，河上无梁空白波。\n西风未起悲龙梭，年年织素攒双蛾。\n江山迢遰无休绝，泪眼看灯乍明灭。\n自从孤馆深锁窗，桂花几度圆还缺。\n鵶鵶向晓鸣森木，风过池塘响丛玉。\n白日萧条梦不成，桥南更问仙人卜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}